for the dependency psycopg[binary]. Both wheels set License-Expression to
LGPL-3.0-only. Each wheel ships this license text:

  psycopg-3.3.6.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE.txt
  psycopg_binary-3.3.6.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE.txt

